      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A brown pterodactyl with an oval body, two long capsule wings, a sphere head, and a cone beak. The head crest is a small flattened cone worked in the same yarn and sewn to the top of the head. The wings are lightly stuffed so they hold their shape when spread."
          }
        ]
      },
